a-prov="cell:PSI-69:main:L38:C5"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="71.2 kPa. Show where this number comes from">71.2 kPa</button></span></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class="border-b border-line py-6 [break-inside:avoid]"><h2 class="eyebrow mb-3">Sources</h2><ol class="space-y-2 text-xs"><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">1</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> probe grid axes (pressure in psi; kPa by psi_to_kpa) v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:axes]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">2</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid, all fuel classes and sources v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:total]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">3</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:gas:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">4</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:gas:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">5</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:gas]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">6</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:droplet:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">7</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:droplet:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">8</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:droplet]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">9</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:solid:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">10</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:solid:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">11</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:solid]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">12</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:emulator:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">13</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:emulator:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">14</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:emulator]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">15</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> cantera_hp_equilibrium_stoich_ch4 v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[ft:c8_2_34]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">16</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:0]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">17</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:1]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">18</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:2]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">19</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:3]</span></span></li></ol><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-2">Cite this point as: Project Redshift (2026). Microgravity fire evidence near 34% O2 and 8.2 psi (nearness step 1x). Redshift microgravity fire evidence dataset, version 2026-11-14+0817d1a144d2, derived from NASA Physical Sciences Informatics. http://localhost:3000/brief?o2=34&amp;p=8.2</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-2">Cite the dataset as: Project Redshift (2026). Redshift microgravity fire evidence dataset, version 2026-11-14+0817d1a144d2. Derived from NASA Physical Sciences Informatics (cite each investigation by its DOI).</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-2">PSI investigations cited by the tests above: <span><a class="mono underline underline-offset-2" href="https://doi.org/10.60555/cyt1-kh64">10.60555/cyt1-kh64</a></span><span>, <a class="mono underline underline-offset-2" href="https://doi.org/10.60555/mbq8-0451">10.60555/mbq8-0451</a></span></p></section></article>"`;

exports[`screens > the panel between candidates 1`] = `"<div class="grid min-h-[calc(100vh-56px)] grid-cols-1 lg:h-[calc(100vh-56px)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_400px] lg:grid-rows-1 lg:overflow-hidden"><section class="sheet-pad flex min-h-0 flex-col" aria-label="The oxygen and pressure plane"><div class="plane-stage"><header class="intro-hide px-4 pb-2 pt-4 lg:px-6"><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-heading" aria-live="polite"><span>Microgravity fire tests by oxygen and cabin pressure.</span></h1></header><div class="navy navy-fill relative mx-2 min-h-0 flex-1 rounded-t-xl px-2 pb-2 lg:mx-4 lg:px-3"><div class="relative h-full w-full select-none"><div class="plane-tools intro-hide absolute z-10" style="left:64px;top:6px;max-width:888px"><div role="toolbar" aria-label="Plane tools" class="toolbar flex-wrap"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Solids only" data-tip="Keep only solid-material evidence (S)" class="tool"><span class="switch" aria-hidden="true"></span> Solids only</button><span class="toolbar-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="relative"><button type="button" class="tool" aria-label="Candidates" data-tip="Candidates" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 14.5S3.25 10.25 3.25 6.5a4.75 4.75 0 0 1 9.5 0C12.75 10.25 8 14.5 8 14.5Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="6.5" r="1.75"></circle></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><button type="button" class="tool" aria-label="Layers" data-tip="Layers" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.75 14.25 5 8 8.25 1.75 5Z"></path><path d="M1.75 8 8 11.25 14.25 8"></path><path d="M1.75 11 8 14.25 14.25 11"></path></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><button type="button" class="tool" aria-label="Zoom" data-tip="Zoom: Habitat range" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.25 5.75v-3.5h3.5M10.25 2.25h3.5v3.5M13.75 10.25v3.5h-3.5M5.75 13.75h-3.5v-3.5"></path></svg></button></div><button type="button" class="tool" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Select area" data-tip="Select an area (B)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.25 4.25v-2h2M7 2.25h2M11.75 2.25h2v2M13.75 7v2M13.75 11.75v2h-2M9 13.75H7M4.25 13.75h-2v-2M2.25 9V7"></path></svg></button><span class="toolbar-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Geiger clicks" data-tip="Geiger clicks: hear the tests near the probe" class="tool"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.75 6.25v3.5h2.5L8 12.75V3.25L4.25 6.25Z"></path><path d="M10.75 6a3 3 0 0 1 0 4M12.75 4a5.75 5.75 0 0 1 0 8"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="transform-origin:0 0"><svg width="960" height="640" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 block" style="will-change:transform"><defs><pattern id="hatch-sea" width="7" height="7" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="7" stroke="var(--hatch)" stroke-width="1"></line></pattern><clipPath id="plane-clip-land"><rect width="848" height="428"></rect></clipPath><mask id="plane-land-mask"><path d="M911.6,0L911.6,4.9L904.5,6.1L897.5,7.3L897.5,