fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas flame</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid material</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid emulator (BRE)</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="2"></path></svg> Verified paper</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink"><path d="M8 14.5S3.25 10.25 3.25 6.5a4.75 4.75 0 0 1 9.5 0C12.75 10.25 8 14.5 8 14.5Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="6.5" r="1.75"></circle></svg> Candidate (inland, coast, at sea: the evidence, not risk)</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="20" height="8" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="var(--isotherm)"></line></svg> Flame temperature (explains, does not predict)</span><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet ml-auto max-lg:hidden"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.25" y="3.75" width="13.5" height="8.5" rx="1.25"></rect><path d="M4 6.5h.01M6.67 6.5h.01M9.33 6.5h.01M12 6.5h.01M5 9.5h6"></path></svg> Shortcuts <span class="kbd" aria-hidden="true">?</span></button></div></section><aside class="sheet intro-dim lg:relative lg:min-h-0 lg:overflow-y-auto lg:border-l lg:border-line lg:bg-[color:var(--surface)]" data-snap="peek" aria-label="Evidence near the probe" style="--sheet-visible:280px"><button type="button" class="sheet-grip sticky top-0 z-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] focus-visible:outline-offset-[-4px] lg:hidden" style="touch-action:none" aria-label="Evidence sheet, peek, showing the readout" aria-describedby=":R2:"><span class="sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><span id=":R2:" hidden="">Press to step through peek, half and full; drag it, or use the arrow keys, to resize. Escape leaves full.</span><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span><div class="accent-bar h-1 max-lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flex min-h-full flex-col" data-testid="evidence-panel"><header class="px-5 pb-4 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="eyebrow">Probe</span></div><h2 class="mt-1 text-title num max-sm:text-heading"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="31%. Show where this number comes from">31%</button></span> <span class="text-ink-3">O2</span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="9 psi. Show where this number comes from">9 psi</button></span> <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-2">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="62.1 kPa. Show where this number comes from">62.1 kPa</button></span>)</span></h2><p class="mt-3 text-body font-semibold text-ink lg:text-heading" aria-live="polite"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40. Show where this number comes from">40</button></span> tests sit near this point. Solid material: <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> from PSI tables, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:published_paper"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="6. Show where this number comes from">6</button></span> from verified papers.</p><ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:max-lg:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Tests near this point by fuel class" data-sheet-peek=""><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:gas:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="11. Show where this number comes from">11</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:droplet:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="23. Show where this number comes from">23</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2">plus <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:published_paper"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="6. Show where this number comes from">6</button></span> from verified papers</span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="true"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> BRE emulator</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:emulator:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 italic">no tests recorded</span></span></li></ul></header><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-gap" data-sheet-half=""><div class="raised relative py-2 pl-4 pr-3"><span class="hatch-bg absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-2 rounded-l-lg border-r border-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 id="sec-gap" class="eyebrow">What&#x27;s missing</h2><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet -mr-2">Access gap chart</button></div><ul class="mt-1"><li class="pb-0.5 pt-1 text-xs text-ink-3 ">Near this oxygen (within the nearness window), but no pressure recorded</li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">BRE sessions (chamber pressure)</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:emulator"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="16. Show where this number comes from">16</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm border-t border-line"><span class="text-ink-2">No prebreathe figure for this point</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><a class="tap text-xs text-ink-2 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink" href="/methods?open=prebreathe">Source</a></span></li></ul><p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 border-t border-line pt-1.5 text-xs"><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/planner">Tests that would fill gaps like these</a><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/request">Ask NASA for the data</a></p></div></section><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-lines"><h2 id="sec-lines" class="eyebrow">Tests near, along each axis</h2><div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="text-ink-2">Along oxygen at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="9 psi. Show where this number comes from">9 psi</button></span></span><span class="text-ink">at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="31%. Show where this number comes from">31%</button></span>, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40 tests. Show where this number comes from">40 tests</button></span></span></div><div role="sli