n="plane" aria-label="Oxygen against cabin pressure. Probe at 34% O2 · 8.2 psi, on 8.2 psi / 34% O2, inland. The word describes the recorded evidence near this point, not fire risk. Arrow keys move the probe one grid step, Alt with an arrow moves ten, Shift with an arrow jumps to the next candidate atmosphere, Enter opens its dossier, B selects an area." class="absolute inset-0 block rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px]" style="will-change:transform"><defs><clipPath id="plane-clip-overlay"><rect width="848" height="428"></rect></clipPath></defs><g transform="translate(56,52)"><g clip-path="url(#plane-clip-overlay)"><g></g><g><g class="intro-hide"><g style="transform:translate(537.0666666666666px, 299.6252649978368px);transition:transform var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)" pointer-events="none"><g class="layer" data-on="true"><ellipse rx="212" ry="137.5559334947602" fill="var(--probe)" fill-opacity="0.035" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.45" stroke-width="1"></ellipse></g><line x1="-537.0666666666666" x2="310.9333333333334" y1="0" y2="0" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.35"></line><line y1="-299.6252649978368" y2="128.37473500216322" x1="0" x2="0" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-opacity="0.35"></line><circle r="12" fill="none" stroke="var(--probe)" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle r="3" fill="var(--probe)"></circle><g transform="translate(16,-32)"><rect width="128" height="24" rx="4" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)"></rect><text x="8" y="16" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)" class="num">34% O2 · 8.2 psi</text></g></g></g></g></g><rect width="848" height="428" fill="transparent" style="cursor:grab;touch-action:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none"></rect></g></svg><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span></div></div></div><div class="navy navy-fill mx-2 mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 rounded-b-xl px-4 pb-3 pt-1 text-xs text-ink-2 lg:mx-4"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-sm border border-[color:var(--coast)] bg-[color:var(--land)]"></span> Land: tests near</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="hatch-bg inline-block h-3 w-5 rounded-sm border border-line bg-[color:var(--sea)]"></span> Sea: no tests near, unknown, not safe</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas flame</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid material</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid emulator (BRE)</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="none" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="2"></path></svg> Verified paper</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" class="text-ink"><path d="M8 14.5S3.25 10.25 3.25 6.5a4.75 4.75 0 0 1 9.5 0C12.75 10.25 8 14.5 8 14.5Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="6.5" r="1.75"></circle></svg> Candidate (inland, coast, at sea: the evidence, not risk)</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="20" height="8" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="var(--isotherm)"></line></svg> Flame temperature (explains, does not predict)</span><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet ml-auto max-lg:hidden"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.25" y="3.75" width="13.5" height="8.5" rx="1.25"></rect><path d="M4 6.5h.01M6.67 6.5h.01M9.33 6.5h.01M12 6.5h.01M5 9.5h6"></path></svg> Shortcuts <span class="kbd" aria-hidden="true">?</span></button></div></section><aside class="sheet intro-dim lg:relative lg:min-h-0 lg:overflow-y-auto lg:border-l lg:border-line lg:bg-[color:var(--surface)]" data-snap="peek" aria-label="Evidence near the probe" style="--sheet-visible:280px"><button type="button" class="sheet-grip sticky top-0 z-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] focus-visible:outline-offset-[-4px] lg:hidden" style="touch-action:none" aria-label="Evidence sheet, peek, showing the readout" aria-describedby=":R2:"><span class="sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><span id=":R2:" hidden="">Press to step through peek, half and full; drag it, or use the arrow keys, to resize. Escape leaves full.</span><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span><div class="accent-bar h-1 max-lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flex min-h-full flex-col" data-testid="evidence-panel"><header class="px-5 pb-4 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="eyebrow">Candidate atmosphere</span></div><h2 class="mt-1 text-title num max-sm:text-heading"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34%. Show where this number comes from">34%</button></span> <span class="text-ink-3">O2</span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="8.2 psi. Show where this number comes from">8.2 psi</button></span> <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-2">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="56.5 kPa. Show where this number comes from">56.5 kPa</button></span>)</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Low-pressure, high-oxygen candidate</p><p class="mt-3 text-body font-semibold text-ink lg:text-heading" aria-live="polite"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40. Show where this number comes from">40</button></span> tests sit near this point. Solid material: <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num