a-label="NASA labels these &#x27;Unvalidated estimates (i.e., not yet available for flight use)&#x27; and assumes a 6 h EVA at 4.3 psia (NTRS 20220011152, p. 6).. Show where this number comes from">NASA labels these &#x27;Unvalidated estimates (i.e., not yet available for flight use)&#x27; and assumes a 6 h EVA at 4.3 psia (NTRS 20220011152, p. 6).</button></span></span></p></div><div><h3 class="eyebrow mb-1">Nearness step size</h3><div><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Nearness step size" class="relative flex h-10 items-center"><span class="absolute left-3 right-3 top-1/2 h-px bg-[color:var(--line-strong)]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-[color:var(--accent)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] transition-[left] duration-base ease-out" style="left:calc(12px + (100% - 24px) * 0.5)" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="relative flex w-full justify-between"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs text-ink-3 hover:text-ink" data-setting="">0.75x</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-ink" data-setting="">1x</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs text-ink-3 hover:text-ink" data-setting="">1.5x</button></span></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink-2">Near means within <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="1.5 steps. Show where this number comes from">1.5 steps</button></span> of the point. At <span data-setting="">1x</span> one step is <span class="relative 