button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">What did FLEX show about carbon dioxide suppression near 10.4 psi?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Which atmosphere should NASA choose for the Moon base?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Is there partial-gravity fire data for the Moon?</button></div><div aria-live="polite" class="mt-4"></div></div></section><p class="border-t border-line px-5 py-4 text-xs text-ink-3">Redshift informs a decision; it does not rank or recommend an atmosphere. Empty means unknown, never safe.</p><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-10 mt-auto border-t border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] px-3 py-2"><nav aria-label="Take this point further"><ul class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1"><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/dossiers/candidate/c8_2_34"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.75 4.25a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5l1.5 1.75h5.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6.75a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2.75a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg>Dossier</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/evidence?near=34,8.2,1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusabl