class="eyebrow mb-1">Flame temperature</h3><p class="text-sm"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="ft:grid"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="2,604 K. Show where this number comes from">2,604 K</button></span> <span class="text-xs text-ink-2">At the nearest computed point, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="ft:grid"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40.0%. Show where this number comes from">40.0%</button></span> and <span class="relative inline " data-prov="ft:grid"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="4.0 psi. Show where this number comes from">4.0 psi</button></span>. Values between computed points are not interpolated.</span></p><p class="mt-1 text-xs italic text-ink-2">Stoichiometric methane. Explains how hot a flame can get; it does not predict ignition or spread.</p></div><div><h3 class="eyebrow mb-1">Prebreathe</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-2">No published prebreathe figure for this atmosphere.</p></div><div><h3 class="eyebrow mb-1">Nearness step size</h3><div><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Nearness step size" class="relative flex h-10 items-center"><span class="absolute left-3 right-3 top-1/2 h-px bg-[color:var(--line-strong)]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-[color:var(--accent)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] transition-[left] duration-base ease-out" style="left:calc(12px + (100% - 24px) * 0.5)" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="relative flex w-full justify-between"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs text-ink-3 hover:text-ink" data-setting="">0.75x</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-ink" data-setting="">1x</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs text-ink-3 hover:text-ink" data-setting="">1.5x</button></span></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink-2">Near means within <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="1.5 steps. Show where this number comes from">1.5 steps</button></span> of the point. At <span data-setting="">1x</span> one step is <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="5 O2 points. Show where this number comes from">5 O2 points</button></span> or a pressure ratio of <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="1.25. Show where this number comes from">1.25</button></span>. The step sizes are a judgement; counts at each stop are computed by the build. <a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/methods?open=nearness">Why these steps</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-line px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="sec-ask" data-testid="ask"><h2 id="sec-ask" class="eyebrow mb-3">Ask the evidence</h2><div><form class="flex gap-2"><label for="ask-input" class="sr-only">Ask a question about the evidence</label><input id="ask-input" class="field" placeholder="Has a solid ever burned near 8.2 psi?" autocomplete="off" value=""><button type="submit" class="btn">Ask</button></form><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Questions with checked answers" data-prompt=""><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">What fire tests exist near 8.2 psi and 34% oxygen?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">If NASA has already burned fabric in near-Moon-base air, why can't a researcher download it?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Has a solid material ever been burned near a candidate Moon-base atmosphere?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Why can't the ACME BRE data be placed on the trade map?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">What did FLEX show about carbon dioxide suppression near 10.4 psi?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Which atmosphere should NASA choose for the Moon base?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Is there partial-gravity fire data for the Moon?</button></div><div aria-live="polite" class="mt-4"></div></div></section><p class="border-t border-line px-5 py-4 text-xs text-ink-3">Redshift informs a decision; it does not rank or recommend an atmosphere. Empty means unknown, never safe.</p><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-10 mt-auto border-t border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] px-3 py-2"><nav aria-label="Take this point further"><ul class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1"><li><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby=":Rcea:" title="Dossiers cover the named atmospheres: snap the probe to one"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.75 4.25a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5l1.5 1.75h5.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6.75a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2.75a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg>Dossier</button><span id=":Rcea:" class="sr-only">Dossiers cover the named atmospheres: snap the probe to one</span></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/evidence?near=40,4,1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.25 4h.01M2.25 8h.01M2.25 12h.01M5.25 4h8.5M5.25 8h8.5M5.25 12h8.5"></path></svg>Tests</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/compare?pts=40,4;34,8.2&amp;m=1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5.25h10M9.5 2.75 12 5.25 9.5 7.75"></path><path d="M14 10.75H4M6.5 8.25 4 10.75l2.5 2.5"></path></svg>Compare</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/brief?o2=40&amp;p=4"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.25 1.75H4.25a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4.75Z"></path><path d="M9.25 1.75v3h3.5M5.75 8.5h4.5M5.75 11h4.5"></path></svg>Brief</a></li><li><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10V1.75M5.25 4.5 8 1.75l2.75 2.75"></path><path d="M3.75 7.5v5.75a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V7.5"></path></svg>Share</button></li></ul></nav></div></div>"`;

exports[`the instrument panel > matches its snapshot between candidates, 9 psi and 31% O2 1`] = `"<div class="flex min-h-full flex-col" data-testid="evidence-panel"><header class="px-5 pb-4 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="eyebrow">Probe</span></div><h2 class="mt-1 text-title num max-sm:text-heading"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="31%. Show where this number comes from">31%</button></span> <span class="text-ink-3">O2</span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="9 psi. Show where this number comes from">9 psi</button></span> <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-2">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="62.1 kPa. Show where this number comes from">62.1 kPa</button></span>)</span></h2><p class="mt-3 text-body font-semibold text-ink lg:text-heading" aria-live="polite"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40. Show where this number comes from">40</button></span> tests sit near this point. Solid material: <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> from PSI tables, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:published_paper"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="6. Show where this number comes from">6</button></span> from verified papers.</p><ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:max-lg:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Tests near this point by fuel class" data-sheet-peek=""><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:gas:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="11. Show where this number comes from">11</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:droplet:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="23. Show where this number comes from">23</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2">plus <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:published_paper"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="6. Show where this number comes from">6</button></span> from verified papers</span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="true"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> BRE emulator</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:emulator:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 italic">no tests recorded</span></span></li></ul></header><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-gap" data-sheet-half=""><div class="raised relative py-2 pl-4 pr-3"><span class="hatch-bg absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-2 rounded-l-lg border-r border-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 id="sec-gap" class="eyebrow">What's missing</h2><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet -mr-2">Access gap chart</button></div><ul class="mt-1"><li class="pb-0.5 pt-1 text-xs text-ink-3 ">Near this oxygen (within the nearness window), but no pressure recorded</li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">BRE sessions (chamber pressure)</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:emulator"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="16. Show where this number comes from">16</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm border-t border-line"><span class="text-ink-2">No prebreathe figure for this point</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><a class="tap text-xs text-ink-2 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink" href="/methods?open=prebreathe">Source</a></span></li></ul><p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 border-t border-line pt-1.5 text-xs"><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/planner">Tests that would fill gaps like these</a><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/request">Ask NASA for the data</a></p></div></section><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-lines"><h2 id="sec-lines" class="eyebrow">Tests near, along each axis</h2><div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="text-ink-2">Along oxygen at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="9 psi. Show where this number comes from">9 psi</button></span></span><span class="text-ink">at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="31%. Show where this number comes from">31%</button></span>, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40 tests. Show where this number comes from">40 tests</button></span></span></div><div role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Tests near points along oxygen at this pressure. Arrow keys move the cursor." aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="170" aria-valuenow="32" aria-valuetext="at 31%, 40 tests near" class="relative mt-1 cursor-crosshair rounded-sm border-b border-line-strong" style="height:32px"><span class="hatch-bg absolute inset-y-0 opacity-60" style="left:35.67251461988304%;width:64.32748538011695%" aria-hidden="true"></span><svg class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full" viewBox="0 0 171 32" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,32V16.57943925233645H1V32ZM1,32V14.336448598130843H2V32ZM2,32V14.336448598130843H3V32ZM3,32V9.009345794392523H4V32ZM4,32V9.009345794392523H5V32ZM5,32V6.205607476635514H6V32ZM6,32V6.205607476635514H7V32ZM7,32V4.523364485981308H8V32ZM8,32V4.242990654205606H9V32ZM9,32V3.6822429906542062H10V32ZM10,32V3.6822429906542062H11V32ZM11,32V3.6822429906542062H12V32ZM12,32V3.6822429906542062H13V32ZM13,32V3.6822429906542062H14V32ZM14,32V4.523364485981308H15V32ZM15,32V4.523364485981308H16V32ZM16,32V4.523364485981308H17V32ZM17,32V2H18V32ZM18,32V5.084112149532711H19V32ZM19,32V4.803738317757009H20