ce-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">What did FLEX show about carbon dioxide suppression near 10.4 psi?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Which atmosphere should NASA choose for the Moon base?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Is there partial-gravity fire data for the Moon?</button></div><div aria-live="polite" class="mt-4"></div></div></section><p class="border-t border-line px-5 py-4 text-xs text-ink-3">Redshift informs a decision; it does not rank or recommend an atmosphere. Empty means unknown, never safe.</p><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-10 mt-auto border-t border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] px-3 py-2"><nav aria-label="Take this point further"><ul class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1"><li><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby=":Rcea:" title="Dossiers cover the named atmospheres: snap the probe to one"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.75 4.25a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5l1.5 1.75h5.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6.75a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2.75a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg>Dossier</button><span id=":Rcea:" class="sr-only">Dossiers cover the named atmospheres: snap the probe to one</span></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/evidence?near=31,9,1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.25 4h.01M2.25 8h.01M2.25 12h.01M5.25 4h8.5M5.25 8h8.5M5.25 12h8.5"></path></svg>Tests</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/compare?pts=31,9;34,8.2&amp;m=1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5.25h10M9.5 2.75 12 5.25 9.5 7.75"></path><path d="M14 10.75H4M6.5 8.25 4 10.75l2.5 2.5"></path></svg>Compare</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/brief?o2=31&amp;p=9"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.25 1.75H4.25a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4.75Z"></path><path d="M9.25 1.75v3h3.5M5.75 8.5h4.5M5.75 11h4.5"></path></svg>Brief</a></li><li><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:text-ink-3 aria-disabled:hover:bg-transparent"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10V1.75M5.25 4.5 8 1.75l2.75 2.75"></path><path d="M3.75 7.5v5.75a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V7.5"></path></svg>Share</button></li></ul></nav></div></div>"`;

exports[`the instrument panel > matches its snapshot on a candidate, 8.2 psi and 34% O2 1`] = `"<div class="flex min-h-full flex-col" data-testid="evidence-panel"><header class="px-5 pb-4 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="eyebrow">Candidate atmosphere</span></div><h2 class="mt-1 text-title num max-sm:text-heading"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34%. Show where this number comes from">34%</button></span> <span class="text-ink-3">O2</span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="8.2 psi. Show where this number comes from">8.2 psi</button></span> <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-2">(<span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="56.5 kPa. Show where this number comes from">56.5 kPa</button></span>)</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Low-pressure, high-oxygen candidate</p><p class="mt-3 text-body font-semibold text-ink lg:text-heading" aria-live="polite"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40. Show where this number comes from">40</button></span> tests sit near this point. Solid material: <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> from PSI tables, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:published_paper"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="3. Show where this number comes from">3</button></span> from verified papers.</p><ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:max-lg:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Tests near this point by fuel class" data-sheet-peek=""><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 -4.5,0 A4.5,4.5 0 1,1 4.5,0" fill="var(--gas)" stroke="var(--gas-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Gas</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:gas:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="20. Show where this number comes from">20</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.175 L5.175,4.14 L-5.175,4.14 Z" fill="var(--droplet)" stroke="var(--droplet-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Droplet</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:droplet:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="17. Show where this number comes from">17</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="false"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 "><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M-4.5,-4.5 H4.5 V4.5 H-4.5 Z" fill="var(--solid)" stroke="var(--solid-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> Solid</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 "><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 ">from PSI tables</span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2">plus <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:solid:published_paper"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="3. Show where this number comes from">3</button></span> from verified papers</span></li><li class="tile gap-1 px-3 py-2" data-empty="true"><span class="tile-label flex items-center gap-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="-6 -6 12 12" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block align-[-2px]"><path d="M0,-5.8500000000000005 L5.8500000000000005,0 L0,5.8500000000000005 L-5.8500000000000005,0 Z" fill="var(--emulator)" stroke="var(--emulator-edge)" stroke-width="1"></path></svg> BRE emulator</span><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 -mx-1 w-fit rounded-sm bg-[color:var(--surface-2)] px-1"><span class="tile-value swap-in"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:emulator:psi_table"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span></span><span class="text-xs text-ink-2 italic">no tests recorded</span></span></li></ul></header><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-gap" data-sheet-half=""><div class="raised relative py-2 pl-4 pr-3"><span class="hatch-bg absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-2 rounded-l-lg border-r border-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 id="sec-gap" class="eyebrow">What's missing</h2><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet -mr-2">Access gap chart</button></div><ul class="mt-1"><li class="pb-0.5 pt-1 text-xs text-ink-3 ">Near this oxygen (within the nearness window), but no pressure recorded</li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">BRE sessions (chamber pressure)</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:emulator"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="16. Show where this number comes from">16</button></span></span></li><li class="tap-row flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-1 text-sm pl-3"><span class="text-ink-2">Gas-flame tests</span><span class="flex-none tap-door text-sm font-semibold"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:o2match:gas"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="20. Show where this number comes from">20</button></span></span></li></ul><p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 border-t border-line pt-1.5 text-xs"><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/planner">Tests that would fill gaps like these</a><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/request">Ask NASA for the data</a></p></div></section><section class="px-5 pb-4" aria-labelledby="sec-lines"><h2 id="sec-lines" class="eyebrow">Tests near, along each axis</h2><div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="text-ink-2">Along oxygen at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="8.2 psi. Show where this number comes from">8.2 psi</button></span></span><span class="text-ink">at <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:axes"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34%. Show where this number comes from">34%</button></span>, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="probe:1:total"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="40 tests. Show where this number comes from">40 tests</button></span></span></div><div role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Tests near points along oxygen at this pressure. Arrow keys move the cursor." aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="170" aria-valuenow="38" aria-valuetext="at 34%, 40 tests near" class="relative mt-1 cursor-crosshair rounded-sm border-b border-line-strong" style="height:32px"><span class="hatch-bg absolute inset-y-0 opacity-60" style="left:36.84210526315789%;width:63.1578947368421%" aria-hidden="true"></span><svg class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full" viewBox="0 0 171 32" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,32V17.757575757575758H1V32ZM1,32V15.636363636363637H2V32ZM2,32V14.121212121212121H3V32ZM3,32V14.121212121212121H4V32ZM4,32V14.121212121212121H5V32ZM5,32V12H6V32ZM6,32V7.151515151515152H7V32ZM7,32V6.545454545454543H8V32ZM8,32V4.121212121212121H9V3