g" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> record pressure and <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:3"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> sit near a habitat candidate as downloadable rows.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 lg:mt-6"><span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--line-strong)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--line-strong)"></span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet">Skip intro</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Next</button></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-3 max-lg:hidden">Click the plane, scroll or use the arrow keys. Esc skips.</p></div></div>"`;

exports[`the story intro > beat 3 matches its snapshot, with every number through Value 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[58]" style="touch-action:none"><div class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" aria-hidden="true" data-intro-catcher="true"></div><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="intro-title" aria-describedby="intro-body" class="floating animate-rise fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 p-3 lg:bottom-auto lg:left-auto lg:right-4 lg:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+16px)] lg:w-[368px] lg:p-6"><span class="eyebrow max-lg:sr-only">Four of five</span><div aria-live="polite" class="lg:min-h-[328px]"><h2 id="intro-title" class="swap-in text-heading lg:mt-2 lg:text-display">NASA did burn solids here, in papers.</h2><p id="intro-body" class="swap-in mt-2 text-sm text-ink-2 lg:mt-4 lg:text-base">The outlined squares are NASA's Saffire fire tests, verified from its published papers: <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:paper:0"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="8. Show where this number comes from">8</button></span> burns near a candidate atmosphere, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:paper:1"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> of them downloadable as rows. The evidence exists; a researcher cannot use it.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 lg:mt-6"><span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--line-strong)"></span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet">Skip intro</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Next</button></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-3 max-lg:hidden">Click the plane, scroll or use the arrow keys. Esc skips.</p></div></div>"`;

exports[`the story intro > beat 4 matches its snapshot, with every number through Value 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[58]" style="touch-action:none"><div class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" aria-hidden="true" data-intro-catcher="true"></div><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="intro-title" aria-describedby="intro-body" class="floating animate-rise fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 p-3 lg:bottom-auto lg:left-auto lg:right-4 lg:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+16px)] lg:w-[368px] lg:p-6"><span class="eyebrow max-lg:sr-only">Five of five</span><div aria-live="polite" class="lg:min-h-[328px]"><h2 id="intro-title" class="swap-in text-heading lg:mt-2 lg:text-display">Every number shows its source.</h2><p id="intro-body" class="swap-in mt-2 text-sm text-ink-2 lg:mt-4 lg:text-base">Click any number, such as <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:0"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="263. Show where this number comes from">263</button></span>, to see where it comes from: the file and row, or the paper, page and quote. Then drag the probe to read the evidence anywhere, press S for solid materials only, ask the evidence a question, or take a cited brief and a data request to NASA.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 lg:mt-6"><span class="flex gap-1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="h-1 w-6 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent)"></span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet">Skip intro</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Explore</button></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-3 max-lg:hidden">Click the plane, scroll or use the arrow keys. Esc skips.</p></div></div>"`;
